{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"延续了前文已经确立的喜欢与表达心意之间的拉扯，没有新增具体身份、场景或对白，也没有把珠子中的童年、回家等比喻写成真实经历。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前面已经写明他暂时需要缓过来，后面把这种暂缓具体推进为不急着说出口，前后衔接自然。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前文已经建立了被亲近打动、想流露心意又收住的矛盾，S06将它改写成允许自己先喜欢，不急于言说。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"前面想说却没想清楚要说什么，直接支撑了现在不急着把喜欢说出口的态度。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"不看珠子也能读懂他当下的选择：暂时安心于自己的喜欢，不急着把心意说出来。\",\n  \"progress\": \"是\",\n  \"progress_why\": \"承接S05先缓过来的状态，将前面因发怵或没想清楚而收住的心意，推进为暂时不必急着言说的态度，不只是重复尚未准备好的背景理由。\",\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ee68b0ff-efe6-4503-88a9-952740096f8f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T064803005248Z", "elapsed_seconds": 323.14, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:53:26.152705+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fc7e9f62dc24eb12032c2fa8b3016971ee2723e075c35305e0a00b97279238b3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transpo